  {
   "id": "zvlVOrDKAgAJ",
   "from": "Henrik Andersen",
   "author": "97795dae709f3909",
   "date": "2025-09-15T04:06:37Z",
   "subject": "Re: 2026 meeting of the SEM Working Group",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div>Hi Mariyam, </div><div>thanks for your interest! The Working Group on SEM is an informal group that meets usually once a year. We don&#39;t have any membership fees and we aren&#39;t officially associated with any other organizations. So unless the local organizers in a given year have obtained funding via sponsors, we usually aren&#39;t able to help anyone with travel costs. </div><div>Sorry about that!</div><div>Thanks and take care</div><div>Henrik </div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"auto\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Thursday, September 11, 2025 at 7:34:22 PM UTC+2 <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mariya...@uri.edu</a> wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif;font-size:small\">Hi,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif;font-size:small\">I am new to lavaan group. I am learning to apply SEM in my area of research, and I am interested in this conference. Do we know if they have some travel awards for grad students to attend this conference?</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif;font-size:small\">Best regards,</div></div><div><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><font color=\"#38761d\" face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\"><b>Mariyam Abbas,</b></font></div><div><font color=\"#38761d\" face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\">Ph.D. Candidate (Behavioral Science) |</font><span style=\"color:rgb(56,118,29);font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif\">Department of Psychology (College of Health Sciences),</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(56,118,29);font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif\">Head Teaching Assistant,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(56,118,29);font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif\"> PSY113: General Psychology,</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(56,118,29);font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif\">President| International Graduate Students&#39; Organization- Global Connections,</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(56,118,29);font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif\">Senator| Graduate Student Association,</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(56,118,29);font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif\">Chair| Graduate Student Advocacy Committee, GAU,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(56,118,29);font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></div><div><font color=\"#38761d\" face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\">University of Rhode Island,</font></div><div><font color=\"#38761d\" face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\">Kingston, RI-02881</font></div><div><font color=\"#38761d\" face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"comic sans ms, sans-serif\" color=\"#93c47d\"><i>“If you want to know where your heart is, see where your mind goes when it wanders.” Hazrat Ali (a.s.)</i></font></div><div><font face=\"comic sans ms, sans-serif\" color=\"#93c47d\"><i><br></i></font></div><div><img width=\"96\" height=\"96\" src=\"https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/mail-sig/AIorK4x1gk0ywxtt2AnO_yYjVu-eoFSiSurwAgG3gLYmX4YfgobiuP90vfPzeVTk9AaJ8dhb7c-v3D0\"><img src=\"https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/mail-sig/AIorK4zHzmlsZEgpSfKYs7MxItmYe0oE4m8VPWisu1b9BqqsWDw-EP7kJADCJ0zOsPHXtNVPv6yFM52jhfj3\" width=\"96\" height=\"69\"><b style=\"color:rgb(56,118,29);font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif\"><img width=\"96\" height=\"96\" src=\"https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/mail-sig/AIorK4ylYbU3o6ki_dfH_UoFZNW8tPfLhlUTqBFhCBHbh8LpXe-11W1v0zUSSSmSXNekV9_PZ6xmQnrHiqhD\"></b><font face=\"comic sans ms, sans-serif\" color=\"#93c47d\"><i><br></i></font></div></div></div></div><br></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Thu, Sep 11, 2025 at 1:35 AM Terrence Jorgensen &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">tjorge...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div></div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\">Here is an announcement about an annual SEM meeting in the EU.  It&#39;s not <i>exactly</i> a conference, but rather a working group that began in the 80s, so there are presentations about research in any way involving SEM. </span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\"><a href=\"https://urldefense.com/v3/__https://www.tu-chemnitz.de/hsw/soziologie/Professuren/Empirische_Sozialforschung/SEM/__;!!Jh1S!i5m0P09C4j2qvFdasx9NPuf2comM5dU8Ykum-k0L87NOZdVpwHq6myU2CNNoO9eTRYVPXC1BGIjbSlR5fsGOkDBOxQ$\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://urldefense.com/v3/__https://www.tu-chemnitz.de/hsw/soziologie/Professuren/Empirische_Sozialforschung/SEM/__;!!Jh1S!i5m0P09C4j2qvFdasx9NPuf2comM5dU8Ykum-k0L87NOZdVpwHq6myU2CNNoO9eTRYVPXC1BGIjbSlR5fsGOkDBOxQ$&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792413073345000&amp;usg=AOvVaw37fClRnKUbOO9BUI_OlnRL\">https://www.tu-chemnitz.de/hsw/soziologie/Professuren/Empirische_Sozialforschung/SEM/</a></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\">Dear colleagues, </span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\">On behalf of local organizers Artur Pokropek and colleagues, we are pleased to announce that the next Meeting of the SEM Working Group will take place in Warsaw from 15-17 April 2026. </span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\">At a glance: </span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\"> </span></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px;margin-top:0cm\"><li style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\">Prof. Yves Rosseel (Ghent University) has once again graciously agreed to offer a pre-conference workshop on 15 April </span></li><li style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\">The Meeting proper will take place from 16-17 April in Warsaw, Poland</span></li><li style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\">The Meeting will be hosted by Educational Research Institute – National Research Institute (IBE) and the Institute of Philosophy and Sociology, Polish Academy of Sciences (IFiS PAN)</span></li></ul><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\">More details (programme, venue, registration) as well as the Call for Papers will follow soon. </span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\">If you know other colleagues who may be interested in the 2026 meeting, send them to this site: <a href=\"https://urldefense.com/v3/__https://eur04.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https*3A*2F*2Fwww.tu-chemnitz.de*2Fhsw*2Fsoziologie*2FProfessuren*2FEmpirische_Sozialforschung*2FSEM*2Fnews.php&a