s,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\">on behalf of Artur and colleagues in Poland, </span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\">Henrik</span></p><br>\r\n\r\n<p></p></blockquote></div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;lavaan&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">lavaan+un...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion visit <a href=\"https://urldefense.com/v3/__https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/lavaan/1fa35b17-708f-48a1-ba9d-cc2303b02af9n*40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer__;JQ!!Jh1S!i5m0P09C4j2qvFdasx9NPuf2comM5dU8Ykum-k0L87NOZdVpwHq6myU2CNNoO9eTRYVPXC1BGIjbSlR5fsEuF5bFew$\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://urldefense.com/v3/__https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/lavaan/1fa35b17-708f-48a1-ba9d-cc2303b02af9n*40googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter__;JQ!!Jh1S!i5m0P09C4j2qvFdasx9NPuf2comM5dU8Ykum-k0L87NOZdVpwHq6myU2CNNoO9eTRYVPXC1BGIjbSlR5fsEuF5bFew$&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792413073346000&amp;usg=AOvVaw21y6-113avO-9OXglTr_NP\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/lavaan/1fa35b17-708f-48a1-ba9d-cc2303b02af9n%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\n</blockquote></div>\r\n</blockquote></div>"
